flowchart TB
    PB[(Product Backlog)] --> SP[Sprint Planning]
    SP --> SB[(Sprint Backlog)]
    SB --> D[Daily work + Daily Stand-up]
    D --> T[TDD: test first, then code]
    T --> INC[Working Increment]
    INC --> SR[Sprint Review with faculty]
    SR --> RE[Sprint Retrospective]
    SR -. feedback .-> PB
    RE -. improvements .-> SP
